<title>USA: Monterey Pasta posts Q3 shr loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Monterey Pasta posts Q3 shr loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.68   profit	 $0.02</p>
<p> Net loss		   5,900   profit	   130</p>
<p> Revs			 5,670		    5,090</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.76     loss	 $1.89</p>
<p> Net loss		   6,190     loss	11,950</p>
<p> Revs			18,670		   12,880</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Results for latest quarter and nine months are from continuing operations.</p>
<p>Losses related to discontinued operations in Q3 1995 were $1,090,000 or $0.02 a share.</p>
<p>Losses related to discontinued operations for nine months 1995 were $12,040,000 or $1.91 a share.</p>
